ved foam and chilling light effects, they've crafted a captivating experience for all ages.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-boston-couple-spent-months-wrapping-their-ordinary-home-in-hand-carved-foam-to-create-a-dracula-style-castle-for-halloween-2026-and-their-free-display-has-drawn-visitors-from-other-states-and-70000-video-views/articleshow/135294059.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-boston-couple-spent-months-wrapping-their-ordinary-home-in-hand-carved-foam-to-create-a-dracula-style-castle-for-halloween-2026-and-their-free-display-has-drawn-visitors-from-other-states-and-70000-video-views/articleshow/135294059.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T04:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135294247,imgsize-1463267.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Clooney foundation provides free legal aid to 9,000 women and children, expands mobile clinics]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135301926.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Clooney Foundation for Justice is dedicated to empowering women and girls by providing them with free legal assistance. Since its establishment, over 9,000 women and children have benefitted from these crucial legal services. Partnering with local organizations, they have set up mobile legal clinics in underserved areas, ensuring wider accessibility.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/george-and-amal-clooneys-foundation-reports-free-legal-services-for-over-9000-women-and-children-with-mobile-clinics-taking-help-to-communities-affected-by-child-marriage-and-violence/articleshow/135301926.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/george-and-amal-clooneys-foundation-reports-free-legal-services-for-over-9000-women-and-children-with-mobile-clinics-taking-help-to-communities-affected-by-child-marriage-and-violence/articleshow/135301926.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T03:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135302212,imgsize-86636.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Hawaiian Electric Investor Settlement: Judge okays $47.75m deal; cuts lawyers’ fees to 20%]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135290528.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A federal judge has sanctioned a settlement of $47.75 million in a securities lawsuit involving Hawaiian Electric Industries. This case focused on accusations of misleading wildfire preparedness disclosures. The judge notably slashed the legal fees demanded by the investors' attorneys. From over 67,000 claims submitted, only more than 24,000 were approved, highlighting a substantial rejection rate. Payments to eligible claimants will proceed according to a loss-based distribution strategy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/2023-maui-wildfires-sparked-an-investor-lawsuit-against-hawaiian-electric-now-a-us-judge-has-approved-47-75m-in-settlement-funds-while-cutting-attorneys-requested-fees-by-4-78m-after-examining-billing-records/articleshow/135290528.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/2023-maui-wildfires-sparked-an-investor-lawsuit-against-hawaiian-electric-now-a-us-judge-has-approved-47-75m-in-settlement-funds-while-cutting-attorneys-requested-fees-by-4-78m-after-examining-billing-records/articleshow/135290528.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T02:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135290560,imgsize-2148811.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Inclusive Shops Draw Workers: Robin Rinearson builds disability-friendly jobs; demand now outstrips roles]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135222526.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[By 2026, Robin Rinearson’s ventures, Jake’s Ice Cream and Jake’s Gourmet Popcorn, have emerged as crucial employers for individuals with disabilities. With 35 staff members, these businesses emphasize skills enhancement and sustainable positions. Employees express fulfillment in their jobs and frequently refer friends for openings. A notable waiting list represents the success of Rinearson's inclusive hiring efforts, earning recognition for fostering a supportive community for disabled individuals.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-retired-virginia-optometrist-opened-an-ice-cream-shop-in-2021-to-create-jobs-for-people-with-disabilities-her-two-stores-now-employ-35-and-she-says-there-is-a-waiting-list-to-work-there/articleshow/135222526.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-retired-virginia-optometrist-opened-an-ice-cream-shop-in-2021-to-create-jobs-for-people-with-disabilities-her-two-stores-now-employ-35-and-she-says-there-is-a-waiting-list-to-work-there/articleshow/135222526.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T01:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135222543,imgsize-1575665.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Prince William and Kate Middleton may have been aware of serious allegations against Thomas Markle]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135374759.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Prince William and Kate Middleton may have been made aware of serious allegations against Meghan Markle’s father, Thomas Markle Sr., after a letter was reportedly sent to their shared Kensington Palace office in 2019. The development comes as police investigate separate claims involving suspected child sexual abuse images found at his former home in the Philippines.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/prince-william-and-kate-middleton-may-have-been-aware-of-serious-allegations-against-thomas-markle-in-2019-a-letter-was-sent-to-their-joint-office-with-prince-harry-and-meghan-markle-reports-claim/articleshow/135374759.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/prince-william-and-kate-middleton-may-have-been-aware-of-serious-allegations-against-thomas-markle-in-2019-a-letter-was-sent-to-their-joint-office-with-prince-harry-and-meghan-markle-reports-claim/articleshow/135374759.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T00:14:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135375135,imgsize-108099.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Green Card lottery: Judge freezes reopening of Diversity Visa program for 2027. What happens next?]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135372933.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/green-card-lottery-judge-freezes-reopening-of-diversity-visa-program-for-2027-what-happens-next/articleshow/135372933.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/green-card-lottery-judge-freezes-reopening-of-diversity-visa-program-for-2027-what-happens-next/articleshow/135372933.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T00:05:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135374928,imgsize-44646.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[New York appeals court blocks tenants' $321,728 mould damage claim over delays and missing proof]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135374631.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Recently, a New York appeals court dismissed further claims from tenants regarding property damage in their ongoing case. The court determined that the tenants significantly postponed presenting evidence for their $321,728.79 claim linked to health problems from mould exposure, which initially surfaced in 2018. Adding such claims post-discovery was seen as prejudicial to the landlord, but the case will continue with original personal injury allegations.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-york-tenants-pursuing-a-mould-lawsuit-later-sought-to-add-a-property-damage-claim-listed-at-321728-79-an-appeals-court-has-blocked-the-amendment-over-delay-missing-records-and-prejudice-to-the-landlord/articleshow/135374631.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-york-tenants-pursuing-a-mould-lawsuit-later-sought-to-add-a-property-damage-claim-listed-at-321728-79-an-appeals-court-has-blocked-the-amendment-over-delay-missing-records-and-prejudice-to-the-landlord/articleshow/135374631.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T00:04:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135374875,imgsize-2096221.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Kate Winslet joins Storyline Online, reads Room On The Broom]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135368682.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a delightful initiative by Storyline Online, Kate Winslet recently narrated 'Room on the Broom,' a whimsical story that encourages literacy among children. Featuring a witch and her feline companion, the tale emphasizes themes of generosity and camaraderie, perfect for the Halloween spirit. Winslet's animated narration captivates young audiences, making reading a joy. With various celebrities contributing, Storyline Online provides a treasure trove of literature for families and schools alike.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/kate-winslet-reads-room-on-the-broom-for-children-during-the-halloween-season-adding-its-104th-read-aloud-to-storyline-onlines-free-literacy-library/articleshow/135368682.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/kate-winslet-reads-room-on-the-broom-for-children-during-the-halloween-season-adding-its-104th-read-aloud-to-storyline-onlines-free-literacy-library/articleshow/135368682.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-30T23:51:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135368759,imgsize-112582.cms"/></item></channel></rss>